CV Desktop Editor

This is a source-available portfolio project by Jordy Retana.

The repository demonstrates a commercial-style desktop application architecture:
- WPF desktop application
- ATS-friendly resume PDF generation
- PDF import and parsing
- license activation backend
- Supabase/PostgreSQL persistence
- Velopack packaging
- admin and client build flows
- Render deployment configuration

The source code is visible so companies and reviewers can evaluate implementation quality.
The code is not open source and is not licensed for reuse, redistribution, resale, or commercial use.

Secrets, production credentials, generated installers, user data, local CV files, and build artifacts are intentionally excluded from the repository.
